{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:37:07.391001208Z","verse":31,"ref":"leviticus 26:31","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":26,"translation":"And I will make your cities a desolation, and I will lay waste your sanctuaries, and I will not smell your soothing aroma.","tokens":[{"surface":"ונתתי","gloss":"and I will make"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your cities"},{"surface":"עריכם","gloss":"your cities"},{"surface":"חרבה","gloss":"a desolation"},{"surface":"והשמותי","gloss":"and I will make desolate"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your sanctuaries"},{"surface":"מקדשיכם","gloss":"your sanctuaries"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"אריח","gloss":"I will smell"},{"surface":"בריח","gloss":"the aroma"},{"surface":"ניחחכם","gloss":"corrected gloss: soothing of yours"}]}